    "backstory": "Hatched in the toxic Mudflats, Ash learnt early that trust is a fool's game. He scavenged through ruins of Subchain City, eventually stumbling upon Ashock's Shadow Lair, a hideout for the cunning and ruthless. Now, he uses his knowledge of the shadows to exploit the weaknesses of rival flocks.",
    "class": "Shadow Raider",
