    "personality": "Cynical and Opportunistic: Ash sees every situation as a potential hustle. Resourceful and Deceptive: With his dirt-covered feathers and phantom visage, Ash blends into the shadows, always finding a way to turn the odds in his favor. Unreliable: Ash is loyal only to himself, and will betray anyone for a bigger piece of the DRIP.",
